state each measure Lean found (`showInferredTerminationBy`) after its declaration

Evidence (elab --project --counts):
  27 declarations without `termination_by` in 15 files: Lean tries measures until one works, running `decreasing_tactic` for each
  `decreasing_tactic` ran 193× in 25 files in all
  their `decreasing_tactic` calls cost 133555.16 kHB (each declaration's own; these do not overlap one another)

leanprof fix --elab --project, checked by leanprof experiment fix-project-1301128570 (try 1): KEEP against 66e469188fe0
